B.Ws=new A.jC("wand","WAND","w",2,18,32,!0,3,"DEGAUSSING WAND \u2014 a hard magnetic wipe across the desk. Strips a mask, puts the transmitters back on air, makes her hand the pile back, and stops the lines ringing. It does not banish anything.")
B.Wt=new A.jC("splice","SPLICE","e",2,15,26,!0,2,"SPLICER \u2014 cuts the frame it entered on out of the tape and reads it. Strips a mask and narrows the kill down to TWO emergency keys, one of which is right. It never tells you which. You still have to choose.")
